        <mxCell id="l_note" value="Every provider is tried in priority order; the first one with an API key wins. The LLM call has a 20 s timeout and 4096 max tokens. If every provider fails, a deterministic structured lesson keeps the day page rendering — the app never 500s on a missing API key." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef9c3;strokeColor=#eab308;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="1300" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
